WEBVTT

00:37.560 --> 00:38.760
Finally,

00:38.840 --> 00:41.000
the time for departure has come.

00:42.600 --> 00:45.160
Everyone is sad about graduating

00:45.640 --> 00:48.280
as if everything in their life
is about to end

00:48.920 --> 00:51.800
and they don't want to start
the next phase of their life.

01:00.040 --> 01:03.240
Many think that after this,

01:03.320 --> 01:05.360
everything will become part of the past.

01:06.360 --> 01:08.960
They are good memories
that we don't want to forget.

01:10.040 --> 01:11.880
However, this might not be the end of it.

01:12.240 --> 01:16.160
It might be the start of the discovery

01:16.640 --> 01:19.240
of all the ugly truths.

01:24.680 --> 01:27.240
And a lot of times,

01:27.600 --> 01:29.800
the past is not as beautiful
as how we remember it.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.080
GRADE 12-1 HOMECOMING, 12TH ANNIVERSARY
SAKNUSORN 114TH ALUMNI

02:59.160 --> 03:01.160
Good evening, everybody.

03:01.240 --> 03:03.360
Let me hear a round of applause

03:03.440 --> 03:05.360
for Saknusorn 114th Alumni.

03:05.440 --> 03:07.120
GRADE 12-1 HOMECOMING
SAKNUSORN 114TH ALUMNI

03:07.200 --> 03:08.440
TILL DEATH DO US APART

03:08.520 --> 03:09.720
Amazing.

03:09.800 --> 03:13.400
The sound of the applause was so loud,
even people in Chiang Mai could hear it.

03:13.480 --> 03:15.960
For those who are thirsty, come here.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.440
For those who are hungry, go over there.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.240
Restrooms are in the back.

03:20.320 --> 03:21.320
Let's jump right into it.

03:21.400 --> 03:22.440
Okay, everyone.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.160
Cheers!

03:25.840 --> 03:27.640
-Let's go.
-Cheers!

03:30.720 --> 03:32.040
Hey, assholes.

03:32.120 --> 03:33.800
-What's wrong with you guys?
-What the hell?

03:34.040 --> 03:36.440
I spilled my drink because of you, jerk.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.120
Oh, Thap, you dick.

03:38.200 --> 03:39.920
-Fong. Asshole.
-Hi.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.000
Hi.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.160
Why did you call my girlfriend asshole?

03:43.240 --> 03:45.720
What? Who would dare
to call an angel that?

03:45.800 --> 03:46.640
Right, Fong?

03:47.120 --> 03:49.400
Wait. You guys still don't have
the class shirts.

03:49.480 --> 03:50.880
-That's true.
-I'll get them for you.

03:50.960 --> 03:53.160
Meng, don't. I'll do it.

03:53.480 --> 03:54.920
What?

03:55.280 --> 03:56.560
-He went just like that?
-Yeah.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.000
Fong! I haven't seen you
in a long time. I missed you.

03:59.080 --> 03:59.960
Hey.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.760
-How are you? Everything okay?
-Yeah.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.680
How are you?

04:04.760 --> 04:06.320
What about you? Happy?

04:06.840 --> 04:08.320
Yeah, you?

04:08.800 --> 04:10.040
Have you made up with May?

04:10.960 --> 04:12.160
No.

04:12.520 --> 04:13.520
She's got someone new.

04:14.240 --> 04:15.480
Do you want something to drink?

04:15.560 --> 04:17.200
Wow, thank you.

04:17.880 --> 04:19.240
Here. For Fong as well.

04:21.440 --> 04:22.360
Thanks.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.960
Hey.

04:24.040 --> 04:24.960
Yes?

04:33.520 --> 04:35.800
Hey, you like kids now?

04:36.360 --> 04:37.680
No, I don't.

04:37.760 --> 04:38.720
Yes, you do.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.240
-You wolf.
-It's not like that.

04:40.320 --> 04:42.200
-Why?
-I just have this feeling...

04:42.280 --> 04:43.280
What?

04:44.160 --> 04:45.360
That she's kind of familiar?

04:45.440 --> 04:47.760
Oh, familiar.

04:47.840 --> 04:49.920
-Yes. That's right.
-Was that the restaurant?

04:50.000 --> 04:51.280
-Yes.
-Fong, here.

04:53.280 --> 04:54.600
What's that? Orange juice.

04:55.000 --> 04:59.080
Well, I quit drinking for a while now,
but I can still have a toast with you.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.640
-Come on.
-All right, okay.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.560
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

05:04.280 --> 05:07.320
Oh, jeez! Look who's here.

05:07.400 --> 05:10.680
Thap and Fong. The eternal couple.

05:10.760 --> 05:13.960
Speaking of the devil, am I right?

05:14.040 --> 05:16.880
Okay, let's do it like this. I get it.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.120
I don't want to talk too much.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.840
Let the photos speak for themselves.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.240
Okay, show them.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.560
Here. How is it? Look.

05:23.640 --> 05:24.920
Two straight faces.

05:25.360 --> 05:27.720
This means they're in love
with each other.

05:27.800 --> 05:29.840
Here, holding a guitar.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.600
Normally, he would play the C chord.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.080
Once he saw Fong clapping for him,

05:33.160 --> 05:35.440
he changed to the love chord. Look.

05:35.520 --> 05:37.320
Wow, look at him go.

05:37.400 --> 05:38.600
Damn!

05:38.680 --> 05:39.960
Very cheesy.

05:40.040 --> 05:43.120
Look at him holding her shoulder,
showing ownership.

05:43.200 --> 05:44.600
He's possessive.

05:44.680 --> 05:45.800
Captain Thap is possessive.

05:45.880 --> 05:47.000
What the hell, man?

05:47.080 --> 05:48.840
As of now, our Fong

05:48.920 --> 05:51.960
has quit her promising AE job,

05:52.040 --> 05:54.680
and is taking care of Captain Thap 24/7.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.720
The moment I knew that,

05:57.120 --> 05:58.920
I was so jealous that I cried.

05:59.000 --> 06:01.280
Okay, everybody. Raise your glasses.

06:01.360 --> 06:03.600
We'll give Thap and Fong our blessing.

06:03.680 --> 06:06.840
The strong couple of grade 12-1.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.840
Cheers!

06:08.920 --> 06:11.160
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

06:37.200 --> 06:39.000
You can't compare me with Thap

06:39.080 --> 06:41.440
because being a flight attendant
is so much more difficult.

06:41.520 --> 06:44.600
I have to take care of the guests,
serve them drinks,

06:44.680 --> 06:46.760
and then I also have
to watch out for perverts.

06:46.840 --> 06:49.560
PROUD
FLIGHT ATTENDANT

06:49.640 --> 06:51.320
EX-DRUM MAJOR
3.0 GPA

06:51.400 --> 06:52.840
Do you want to sell cosmetics with me?

06:52.920 --> 06:54.400
My job is really easy.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.000
You just have to stir the cream,

06:56.080 --> 06:58.480
give it some pretty packaging,
and then you can sell it.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.600
Anyone who's free can join me. It's easy.

07:00.680 --> 07:05.160
BELL
OWNER OF SKIN CARE COMPANY

07:05.240 --> 07:07.360
EX-CHEERLEADER
2.8 GPA

07:07.440 --> 07:09.800
Wow, I'm so lucky.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.640
The reunion of the Angel Gang.

07:11.720 --> 07:15.320
WIT
ENERGY ENGINEER

07:15.400 --> 07:18.440
PRESIDENT OF SAKNUSORN 114TH
3.2 GPA

07:18.520 --> 07:20.640
-Let's toast.
-Okay.

07:20.720 --> 07:21.640
Can't you remember?

07:21.720 --> 07:24.400
You locked me in the bathroom,
and I missed the test.

07:24.480 --> 07:26.120
Of course I do. That was so hilarious.

07:26.200 --> 07:28.720
MENG
FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER

07:28.800 --> 07:31.280
SCHOOL PHOTOGRAPHER
2.5 GPA

07:31.360 --> 07:32.840
I was thinking about buffing up

07:32.920 --> 07:34.320
and fighting you once I'm big enough.

07:34.880 --> 07:36.120
Yeah, that's right. I remember.

07:36.200 --> 07:38.560
CHAI
COMPETITIVE BODYBUILDER

07:38.640 --> 07:40.600
THE CLASS WEAKLING
2.0 GPA

07:40.680 --> 07:41.720
Fuck you. My head--

07:41.800 --> 07:43.480
You guys still haven't stopped fighting?

07:43.560 --> 07:45.200
-Hey.
-Yeah.

07:45.280 --> 07:46.240
-Hi, Kai.
-Doctor Kai.

07:46.320 --> 07:48.840
DOCTOR KAI
HOSPITAL OWNER

07:48.920 --> 07:51.480
SINGLE
4.0 GPA SINCE KINDERGARTEN

07:51.560 --> 07:53.320
-I'm all in.
-Oh, you guys are here?

07:53.880 --> 07:54.800
-Jerk.
-Jerk.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.000
-How are you?
-Cheers!

07:56.080 --> 07:58.240
SHORTY
CONTRACTOR

07:58.320 --> 08:00.080
ONE WIFE AND ONE KID

08:00.160 --> 08:01.040
Cheers!

08:06.000 --> 08:08.400
-You guys are so slow.
-I can't.

08:08.800 --> 08:11.400
Can you remember
if our class had 30 or 31 people?

08:11.480 --> 08:13.160
I was arguing with Wit earlier.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.640
-Shorty, what the hell?
-You jerk.

08:15.720 --> 08:17.680
-Man, are you drunk already?
-Yeah, probably.

08:17.760 --> 08:20.280
-I'm not drunk.
-Keep talking. Count carefully.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.600
-Wit, come on.
-Was it 30?

08:21.680 --> 08:24.080
-Talk to me when you're done.
-You were the class president.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.440
How can you forget your friend?

08:25.520 --> 08:27.640
He's getting serious all of a sudden.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.880
-Come on.
-He's always like this.

08:29.960 --> 08:31.200
Hey!

08:31.960 --> 08:33.880
-I'm sorry.
-It's okay.

08:35.679 --> 08:36.760
What's your name?

08:37.600 --> 08:39.320
Why don't you think about it?

08:44.520 --> 08:45.600
Almost drunk.

08:49.680 --> 08:51.160
We should toast.

08:51.840 --> 08:53.240
-Let's toast.
-Let's toast.

08:53.320 --> 08:55.240
-Cheers!
-You finally got laid!

08:55.320 --> 08:56.920
I'm happy for your family, Shorty.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.840
Hello, grade 12-1.

09:03.840 --> 09:07.360
We're now at the spot
where we buried our time capsule

09:07.440 --> 09:09.560
12 years ago.

09:09.880 --> 09:11.600
We've been digging for a while,

09:11.680 --> 09:13.880
but we still haven't found the chest.

09:19.840 --> 09:21.040
Hey, what's that smell?

09:21.120 --> 09:22.400
That really stinks.

09:22.480 --> 09:24.760
-Whoa, there are worms.
-Holy shit! Worms.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.680
Gross.

09:26.760 --> 09:28.760
-Shit, come on. Hurry. Let's get it...
-So many worms.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.280
Did you find it?

09:31.200 --> 09:32.840
-I got it.
-Come here.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.360
-Hey, friends.
-Yes.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.160
Right now, we've got the time capsule box

09:37.240 --> 09:39.120
that we buried 12 years ago.

09:39.200 --> 09:40.200
-Yeah.
-Let's go.

09:40.280 --> 09:41.520
It's so fucking exhausting.

09:41.600 --> 09:42.440
Right now,

09:42.520 --> 09:44.720
we'll carry this into the party
and open it together.

09:50.800 --> 09:52.080
Wit, you jerk.

09:54.120 --> 09:56.080
Why didn't you come and help, asshole?

09:56.160 --> 09:57.720
Meng, did you step on shit?

10:01.640 --> 10:02.920
Just do it.

10:03.000 --> 10:03.920
Come on, let's open it.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.520
This key...

10:06.040 --> 10:08.840
I've been keeping it safe for 12 years.

10:09.160 --> 10:10.680
Judging from your faces...

10:11.640 --> 10:13.000
I should open it real quick, right?

10:13.080 --> 10:14.640
-Yeah, just open it.
-Yeah.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.600
I just wanted it to be a bit ceremonial.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.400
Shit!

10:27.480 --> 10:29.320
-What the fuck?
-What is it?

10:29.400 --> 10:30.560
It's rusted.

10:31.680 --> 10:33.040
-Hurry up.
-Smash it.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.320
-Smash?
-Yeah.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.320
Just smash it.

10:35.400 --> 10:36.720
Chai, come here and do it.

10:36.800 --> 10:38.800
Jeez, don't just stand there
flexing your muscles.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.080
-All right.
-I'll handle it.

10:41.760 --> 10:42.720
Hey.

10:46.240 --> 10:48.000
So cool.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.720
That's my man, Chai.

10:50.960 --> 10:52.080
Amazing.

10:52.160 --> 10:53.160
-Shit.
-Whoa, shit.

10:54.640 --> 10:55.640
The smell...

10:56.520 --> 10:57.640
It's not worth it.

10:59.080 --> 11:01.040
Wow, shit.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.280
Look, how is it? Guess whose it is.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.160
Hey, it's mine.

11:06.400 --> 11:08.200
Thank you so much, everyone,

11:08.280 --> 11:10.920
for signing this flag

11:11.000 --> 11:12.600
and being here tonight.

11:13.560 --> 11:15.720
I'm really grateful.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.480
-That was profound.
-Yeah.

11:17.560 --> 11:18.640
Cool.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.840
Yeah!

11:28.280 --> 11:29.680
BODYBUILDING

11:35.920 --> 11:36.960
This.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.560
I don't even have to say who owns this.

11:38.640 --> 11:41.040
They even buried this together.

11:41.120 --> 11:43.160
See? How disgusting.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.120
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

11:44.200 --> 11:47.160
Okay, I'll have to ask
Thap and Fong to come up,

11:47.240 --> 11:49.000
and read their love letters for us.

11:51.240 --> 11:53.080
Wait. Hold on. That's private.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.080
Come on. We're all friends here.

11:55.160 --> 11:56.960
-Yeah.
-Hurry. Come here.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.920
-Yeah.
-Come on.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.240
-Let's go.
-Open it.

12:00.320 --> 12:03.080
-Open it.
-Open it.

12:03.160 --> 12:05.960
-Open it.
-All right. Okay. Fuck you.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.840
Yeah. No need to be nervous.
We're all friends.

12:09.920 --> 12:11.360
-Yeah.
-Are you thirsty?

12:11.440 --> 12:12.280
Yes.

12:13.000 --> 12:15.480
It seems like he's thirsty.
Hey, you. Get him a drink.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.160
Okay, here you go, Captain.

12:29.160 --> 12:30.160
Thank you.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.400
Read it already. People are waiting.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.400
Oh, okay.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.360
Yeah.

12:39.520 --> 12:42.600
"I promise I won't ever leave Fong.

12:44.520 --> 12:46.000
Once I become a pilot,

12:47.080 --> 12:48.560
please marry me.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.400
Not bad at all.

12:56.520 --> 12:57.640
Okay, I'm done.

12:57.960 --> 12:58.960
-Is that it?
-That's it.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.160
Okay, applause.

13:02.480 --> 13:03.880
Very nice.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.240
Fong, what's wrong?

13:09.080 --> 13:10.120
You seem quiet.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.320
We can go home first.

13:18.040 --> 13:20.200
I don't want our friends
to see us like this.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.800
About the party...

13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
There's no need to worry.

13:28.280 --> 13:30.000
You've been like this for almost a week.

13:31.280 --> 13:32.720
What's on your mind?

13:34.320 --> 13:35.440
What about you?

13:37.200 --> 13:38.840
Is there something you want to tell me?

13:41.200 --> 13:42.800
Fong, what exactly do you want to say?

13:43.960 --> 13:44.960
I don't know.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.320
I'm a woman.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.160
I have a gut feeling.

13:51.680 --> 13:52.720
About what?

13:54.640 --> 13:55.760
What did I do?

13:57.120 --> 13:59.400
Don't let me catch you red-handed.

14:01.120 --> 14:03.080
How many times have we talked about this?

14:03.600 --> 14:05.760
Yes, Thap. How many?

14:05.840 --> 14:07.240
Just ask yourself.

14:34.560 --> 14:38.480
Okay. Captain Thap
has already said that much.

14:38.560 --> 14:39.560
Now...

14:40.160 --> 14:41.720
-Yeah.
-In order to make it fair,

14:41.800 --> 14:44.160
Angel Fong has to read it, too.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.320
What's written on the cover?

14:47.800 --> 14:50.480
"Together, we live.
Leave me, you're dead."

14:52.480 --> 14:53.560
Hey.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.200
Let Thap read it himself.

15:02.600 --> 15:04.080
-Here.
-Okay.

15:06.520 --> 15:07.600
"Hi, Thap.

15:10.000 --> 15:13.040
I don't know how long it will take
until you get to read this letter.

15:15.320 --> 15:18.400
I just want to thank you
for always taking care of me,

15:20.520 --> 15:22.160
and for always forgiving me

15:22.960 --> 15:24.480
when I do something wrong.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.280
I just want to tell you

15:37.960 --> 15:39.120
 that if I didn't have you,

15:40.000 --> 15:43.120
I don't know how my life would be,

15:45.080 --> 15:46.680
and I don't want to know that.

15:48.640 --> 15:52.440
So, I've decided
to have you here with me forever,

15:54.040 --> 15:55.840
and I'll do my best to take care of you.

15:57.240 --> 15:59.040
I won't ever let you go.

16:03.000 --> 16:07.600
P.S. The sticker on the front,
I really mean it.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.960
-Damn.
-Wow, shit.

16:14.160 --> 16:15.000
Amazing.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.040
-Here.
-Take it.

16:16.120 --> 16:17.600
Go sit over there. Stand there.

16:17.680 --> 16:18.920
Yeah, go.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.760
-Hey.
-That was so sweet.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.240
Who owns this?
Who hasn't gotten their stuff?

16:24.000 --> 16:26.840
I heard that this model
is really tough and durable.

16:26.920 --> 16:28.600
Whose is it? Anyone?

16:29.480 --> 16:30.320
Anyone?

16:31.000 --> 16:32.840
-Whose is it?
-Whose is it?

16:34.720 --> 16:36.480
There's an extra item?

16:37.960 --> 16:39.720
Wit, you were the class president.

16:39.800 --> 16:40.960
I already told you.

16:41.080 --> 16:43.440
Our class had 31 people, not 30.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.600
Well, fuck you. Think, then.

16:45.680 --> 16:47.400
What's the name of the 31st person?

16:48.640 --> 16:49.920
I'm starting to remember

16:50.000 --> 16:51.760
that our class really had 31 people.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.680
Shit, but I just can't remember who it is.

17:01.280 --> 17:02.440
Nan.

17:02.840 --> 17:04.560
Nan that entered in tenth grade,

17:04.640 --> 17:06.040
and left after less than a semester.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.240
Nanno, the psycho.

17:12.319 --> 17:14.599
GRADE 10-1

17:16.599 --> 17:17.680
Draw the line first.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.720
Good morning.

17:34.560 --> 17:35.880
My name is Nanno.

17:36.360 --> 17:37.680
I'm 16 years old.

17:38.600 --> 17:40.040
Today is my first day.

17:40.520 --> 17:41.840
Please take care of me.

18:03.280 --> 18:04.760
From what I can remember,

18:05.200 --> 18:06.960
Nanno enrolled
in the middle of the semester,

18:07.440 --> 18:08.720
so she didn't have many friends.

18:08.800 --> 18:09.960
Yes.

18:10.400 --> 18:13.200
And she was always
on the phone with her boyfriend.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.680
So we tried to befriend her.

18:19.440 --> 18:20.760
Yes, Tan.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.160
Yes.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.800
See you later.

18:26.560 --> 18:27.440
Yes.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.640
Nanno, let's go for ice cream today.

18:32.720 --> 18:34.640
There's a new shop in front of the school.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.680
Do you want to go?

18:37.200 --> 18:38.600
I'm sorry, but I can't.

18:38.680 --> 18:40.240
I already have an appointment.

18:40.320 --> 18:42.400
With your boyfriend, right?

18:42.480 --> 18:45.120
You're always talking to your boyfriend.

18:45.200 --> 18:47.320
Don't you want to spend
some time with your friends?

18:50.320 --> 18:52.320
Okay, that's all right.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.640
Next time then.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.880
Maybe you can even bring
your boyfriend with you.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.600
-Yes.
-Okay.

18:58.160 --> 19:00.040
Oh, excuse me then.

19:10.320 --> 19:13.320
-Happy Valentine's Day.
-Pretty roses.

19:18.520 --> 19:20.600
-Jerks, don't stick them on me!
-Whose are they for?

19:20.680 --> 19:22.200
-Hey, you.
-Whose are these?

19:22.840 --> 19:23.840
Let's go to my house?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.920
-Stickers.
-Hey, Kai.

19:30.880 --> 19:31.960
Kai.

19:32.600 --> 19:34.640
-Kai, man.
-What the heck are you doing?

19:39.320 --> 19:40.600
Not bad at all.

19:40.680 --> 19:41.600
Kai.

19:41.680 --> 19:43.240
-You want some?
-It's all gone.

19:47.680 --> 19:48.600
Hey.

19:49.560 --> 19:52.760
Amazing.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.640
Let's see.

19:56.240 --> 19:58.360
"Happy Valentine's Day.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.600
From Thap."

20:00.520 --> 20:02.400
Wow, this came with the roses.

20:02.480 --> 20:05.080
-You guys are disgusting.
-That's true.

20:05.160 --> 20:06.240
But this bouquet is small,

20:06.320 --> 20:08.600
-so he must not love you that much.
-Yeah.

20:10.480 --> 20:12.640
But Thap is quite biased.

20:13.200 --> 20:14.960
He only gave these to his girlfriend.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.800
I'm jealous. I want these, too.

20:20.920 --> 20:23.840
Come, let's stick some more of these.
Someone will give you roses, too.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.920
She's blushing.

20:28.960 --> 20:29.800
Here.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.120
Nanno.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.400
-Yes?
-Flower delivery.

20:36.280 --> 20:37.720
Amazing.

20:38.280 --> 20:39.600
It's so big.

20:39.680 --> 20:42.040
Tan must love Nanno very much.

20:42.120 --> 20:43.400
That's so pretty.

20:43.960 --> 20:46.640
If he really loved me,
he would have given them to me himself.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.600
There's a card.

20:47.680 --> 20:49.240
I HOPE YOU'RE HAPPY.
FORGIVE ME. SEE YOU.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.880
It's the same.

20:50.960 --> 20:53.720
I want to see what Tan looks like.

20:53.800 --> 20:55.520
-He must be really handsome.
-Yeah.

20:56.720 --> 20:58.040
And...

20:59.880 --> 21:01.080
In the card...

21:01.840 --> 21:04.480
What did Tan do to make you angry?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.120
It's nothing.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.400
He just doesn't really have time for me.

21:09.960 --> 21:13.240
Despite that,
he still calls you a lot though.

21:13.320 --> 21:16.280
Stop being mad at him
and let us meet him already.

21:16.360 --> 21:17.880
Yeah.

21:17.960 --> 21:20.280
I want to meet him, too.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.520
Your romantic Tan.

21:22.920 --> 21:25.000
Once he's free,
Nanno should tell him to meet with us,

21:25.080 --> 21:27.360
-Right.
-so we can finally go somewhere together.

21:28.320 --> 21:29.960
I'll try, okay?

21:31.560 --> 21:33.320
Your roses are really pretty though.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.480
-Yes.
-Yes.

21:35.040 --> 21:36.280
Fong likes them?

21:37.080 --> 21:38.160
Take them.

21:40.120 --> 21:41.200
Hey.

21:41.280 --> 21:43.200
Tan didn't give them to me.

21:43.600 --> 21:45.120
If you give these to someone else,

21:45.840 --> 21:46.800
he'll be angry.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.800
If Fong doesn't want them...

21:51.680 --> 21:53.160
I'll just give them to someone else.

21:56.760 --> 21:57.840
Nanno.

22:17.280 --> 22:20.680
Nanno promised
that she would let us meet Tan,

22:21.240 --> 22:23.720
but then the plan
would always be interrupted

22:24.440 --> 22:27.120
by all those reasons she came up with.

22:27.880 --> 22:31.160
In the end, Fong just...

22:47.160 --> 22:48.840
Tan can't come here again?

22:50.120 --> 22:51.760
I had to wait for nothing again.

22:51.840 --> 22:54.840
Will I ever get to meet Tan in this life?

23:00.240 --> 23:01.280
I...

23:01.880 --> 23:03.920
will go to the bathroom.

23:05.040 --> 23:05.880
Okay.

23:11.360 --> 23:12.480
Do you think...

23:13.320 --> 23:14.360
that this Tan

23:14.840 --> 23:15.960
really exists?

23:16.320 --> 23:19.000
I agree that something is fishy.

23:19.080 --> 23:19.960
Right?

23:20.480 --> 23:23.000
Who will keep missing
an appointment like this?

23:23.080 --> 23:25.880
I think he doesn't want to meet us.

23:27.040 --> 23:30.080
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

23:32.280 --> 23:33.720
Do you want to prove it?

23:34.680 --> 23:35.880
Are you sure?

23:35.960 --> 23:36.960
Yeah.

23:37.960 --> 23:39.360
I've been curious for quite a while.

23:40.360 --> 23:42.320
CONTACTS

23:43.360 --> 23:44.600
-Shit.
-What is it?

23:45.080 --> 23:46.480
There's nothing here.

23:48.720 --> 23:50.040
Who the hell did she talk to?

23:51.400 --> 23:53.280
-She was always on the phone.
-No incoming calls.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.280
No outgoing calls either.

24:02.760 --> 24:04.240
Do you want to go for ice cream?

24:08.200 --> 24:09.800
Tan is busy,

24:10.200 --> 24:11.440
but I'm free.

24:21.880 --> 24:23.280
What's wrong?

24:23.560 --> 24:24.640
Why are you acting weird?

24:25.720 --> 24:27.760
No. It's nothing.

24:29.640 --> 24:31.080
There's something we need to do.

24:33.840 --> 24:36.120
Oh, what a shame.

24:37.600 --> 24:40.720
Let's eat some ice cream next time, then.

24:40.800 --> 24:42.800
With or without Tan.

24:45.360 --> 24:47.600
Sure, Nanno. Sure.

24:48.480 --> 24:49.440
Sure.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.600
Oh, Tan.

25:01.200 --> 25:03.560
Nanno who was always on her phone

25:04.920 --> 25:06.960
was actually talking to...

25:08.960 --> 25:10.240
the void.

25:11.280 --> 25:12.160
I see.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.280
Yeah, I think I remember her now.

25:15.120 --> 25:16.040
And then what?

25:17.000 --> 25:18.040
Nothing much.

25:18.560 --> 25:20.480
She was on her phone even more,

25:21.200 --> 25:23.200
because no one would talk to her.

25:23.280 --> 25:26.160
Why? I don't get it. Why?

25:27.720 --> 25:28.680
What?

26:55.920 --> 26:57.200
PSYCHO BITCH

26:57.280 --> 26:58.760
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

26:58.840 --> 27:00.200
I'M CREEPED OUT WHEN I SEE YOU

27:00.280 --> 27:01.160
I FUCKING HATE NANNO

27:01.240 --> 27:02.120
FUCK OFF, BITCH

27:02.200 --> 27:03.840
TAN DOESN'T EXIST
GET THE FUCK OUT

27:18.360 --> 27:19.560
And then one day,

27:20.200 --> 27:22.120
someone hit her.

27:22.760 --> 27:24.240
She looked really awful.

27:30.040 --> 27:31.400
I remember that.

27:31.480 --> 27:33.880
It was really scary.
There was blood everywhere.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.760
And then what?

27:46.360 --> 27:47.280
I don't know.

27:47.960 --> 27:50.640
It seems like she disappeared
after that day.

27:51.600 --> 27:53.880
And today, we even forgot

27:54.240 --> 27:55.680
before we saw that cell phone.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.600
Can anyone contact Nanno?

28:00.880 --> 28:02.760
-She's still our friend.
-Why?

28:02.840 --> 28:04.400
Are you going to cure her, Doctor Kai?

28:04.480 --> 28:05.800
I'm not a psychiatrist,

28:07.080 --> 28:08.520
but I still know something

28:08.600 --> 28:09.760
that might be able to help.

28:11.840 --> 28:13.320
I wonder how she is right now.

28:15.800 --> 28:18.360
She's probably lying
in a mental hospital somewhere

28:18.760 --> 28:19.680
being a psycho.

28:24.680 --> 28:25.680
Let me see it.

28:29.840 --> 28:31.160
This is probably not Nanno's

28:31.680 --> 28:33.280
since she left in tenth grade.

28:33.360 --> 28:35.560
She wasn't there
when we buried the time capsule.

28:38.240 --> 28:40.040
This is definitely Nanno's cell phone.

28:40.480 --> 28:41.680
I remember it.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.560
MENU

28:46.640 --> 28:47.720
What?

28:48.240 --> 28:49.600
-It's still working.
-What?

28:49.680 --> 28:50.520
Really?

28:50.600 --> 28:52.560
-It's been buried for 12 years.
-What the fuck?

28:52.640 --> 28:54.880
-True.
-Someone is definitely playing a prank.

29:05.280 --> 29:06.240
-Shit.
-Shit.

29:09.880 --> 29:11.400
Wit, if you're doing this...

29:15.120 --> 29:16.640
Hi, everyone.

29:19.240 --> 29:21.440
Do you still remember me?

29:23.880 --> 29:24.920
It's Nanno.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.560
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:26.640 --> 29:27.840
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:27.920 --> 29:30.080
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:30.160 --> 29:31.880
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:31.960 --> 29:32.880
It's me, Nanno.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.720
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:34.800 --> 29:37.560
It's me, Nanno. Nanno.

30:07.920 --> 30:09.040
Nanno?

30:12.520 --> 30:13.840
You're Nanno, right?

30:16.240 --> 30:18.000
I thought you already forgot.

30:19.080 --> 30:20.800
You remember Nanno now?

30:21.280 --> 30:22.360
Thap.

30:33.680 --> 30:35.280
You missed me, right?

30:37.080 --> 30:38.360
I'm back.

30:47.960 --> 30:48.880
You...

30:49.480 --> 30:51.200
really are Nanno, right?

30:51.880 --> 30:53.720
It has only been a while.

30:54.360 --> 30:56.080
Have you already forgotten my face?

30:56.840 --> 30:59.400
No, it's just that it has been ten years,

30:59.920 --> 31:01.880
but you're still as beautiful as ever.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.320
Now that I think about it,

31:20.880 --> 31:22.480
you guys in grade 12-1

31:23.640 --> 31:25.040
still look the same.

31:26.960 --> 31:29.520
So what are you doing right now?

31:30.080 --> 31:32.080
I'm still talking to the void like before.

31:35.360 --> 31:38.000
But you're this pretty.
You probably already have someone.

31:39.240 --> 31:41.280
Stop. You're making me blush.

31:42.880 --> 31:46.120
But I can't compete

31:46.200 --> 31:48.200
with the middle schoolers.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.120
Did you know

31:58.200 --> 32:00.360
that apart from being a photographer,

32:00.920 --> 32:02.160
Meng is also a star?

32:14.280 --> 32:15.320
It's Meng.

32:17.040 --> 32:18.040
What?

32:20.800 --> 32:23.120
-What?
-Shit.

32:30.640 --> 32:32.680
Okay, let's pause.

32:32.760 --> 32:33.960
Think of that as a trailer.

32:34.040 --> 32:36.960
If you guys want to see the full version,
download it.

32:37.040 --> 32:39.040
It will probably take months
to watch all of it.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.440
Meng, you pervert.

32:42.000 --> 32:45.080
No. Don't be mean with your friend, Chai.

32:45.560 --> 32:49.440
Chai will have to cut down
on the steroids, too.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.560
I heard your medals got forfeited.

32:55.480 --> 32:57.480
If the association didn't cover it up,

32:58.040 --> 32:59.720
you could be in a big trouble.

33:02.840 --> 33:04.280
Nanno, what do you want?

33:04.760 --> 33:06.920
I see you're having a party,

33:07.480 --> 33:09.600
so I definitely can't come empty-handed.

33:09.680 --> 33:12.280
That's why I prepared these gifts
to surprise you.

33:13.320 --> 33:14.720
Like this one.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.720
This building
looks pretty familiar, right?

33:23.120 --> 33:24.120
Wit.

33:24.200 --> 33:25.480
Your company

33:25.960 --> 33:27.600
built this building, right?

33:27.680 --> 33:29.720
35-STOREY BUILDING COLLAPSED
CULPRIT IN CUSTODY

33:29.800 --> 33:31.320
Why was the person in the custody

33:31.400 --> 33:32.960
not you, Wit?

33:34.320 --> 33:35.800
Hiring someone else

33:36.200 --> 33:37.880
to go to jail for you

33:39.480 --> 33:41.520
has a very severe punishment.

33:43.160 --> 33:44.880
If the police find out about this,

33:45.320 --> 33:47.160
Wit will face serious consequences.

33:48.600 --> 33:49.720
I'm worried about you.

33:50.000 --> 33:51.760
Nanno, what do you want?

33:51.840 --> 33:53.080
Can we make a deal?

33:53.160 --> 33:55.120
Make a deal

33:55.200 --> 33:58.200
like what Doctor Kai did
with the politicians, right?

33:58.640 --> 34:01.040
Their money was used to build a hospital

34:01.120 --> 34:02.640
for money laundering.

34:02.720 --> 34:03.880
Cool, right?

34:03.960 --> 34:06.160
A hospital

34:06.240 --> 34:07.720
with no patients,

34:08.360 --> 34:10.960
but has a monthly income
worth tens of millions.

34:11.960 --> 34:14.040
You think you're superior
only because of this?

34:14.440 --> 34:15.920
You're just a stupid bitch.

34:17.560 --> 34:19.080
Isn't that too harsh, Bell?

34:19.639 --> 34:22.840
I don't want to be superior.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.639
Especially with you, Bell.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.239
I don't have the guts to fight you.

34:29.920 --> 34:32.920
I heard you're selling skin care products.

34:33.000 --> 34:34.560
It was sold out.

34:35.080 --> 34:37.719
The sales were so good
you opened another brand,

34:38.679 --> 34:40.080
selling fake cream.

34:40.159 --> 34:42.159
Once a customer called them out,

34:42.239 --> 34:43.480
they closed the page.

34:43.600 --> 34:45.080
WARNING. FAKE.

34:45.159 --> 34:46.480
RUINED FACE. CHEAP BUT FAKE.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.800
Guys, don't listen to her. She's a psycho.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.560
Just grab her cell phone.

34:54.560 --> 34:56.199
-Calm down.
-Wit, what the hell?

34:56.719 --> 34:58.760
If we all know each other's secret

34:58.840 --> 35:00.360
and no one says anything,

35:00.760 --> 35:02.240
it'll just end here.

35:17.440 --> 35:20.160
Let's see if there's anything else
you can do, bitch.

35:28.480 --> 35:29.880
Shorty.

35:31.000 --> 35:33.200
This violent behavior of yours...

35:33.800 --> 35:35.280
You still have it.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.320
No wonder.

35:38.400 --> 35:39.720
Your wife wants a divorce,

35:40.680 --> 35:43.120
and also wants to sue you
for your daughter's custody, right?

35:43.200 --> 35:45.520
I'm going to win the case.
Don't you worry.

35:50.640 --> 35:52.280
I'll tell you something.

35:52.880 --> 35:54.760
You will never win the case.

35:55.720 --> 35:57.120
You'll lose your daughter, too.

35:59.480 --> 36:00.920
Shorty's wife is pretty smart.

36:01.000 --> 36:02.520
She shouldn't have been dumb enough

36:02.600 --> 36:04.480
to marry you.

36:10.080 --> 36:11.640
I'll move into my mom's.

36:13.960 --> 36:15.160
I'll take my daughter, too.

36:15.640 --> 36:18.280
Bitch, I already told you
to drop the subject.

36:18.360 --> 36:21.160
-Right?
-Daddy, don't hurt Mommy.

36:22.320 --> 36:23.720
You think you're good, don't you?

36:23.800 --> 36:24.720
No.

36:26.960 --> 36:29.520
The evidence speaks for itself.

36:31.040 --> 36:33.080
-This is worse than mine.
-Oh, my god.

36:33.800 --> 36:35.880
Hot-headed and abusive.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.600
The court won't sympathize with you.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.480
Getting to see you guys

36:55.800 --> 36:58.040
grow up to have good lives like this

36:58.800 --> 37:00.320
makes me really happy.

37:01.880 --> 37:03.560
Let's forget

37:04.120 --> 37:05.280
about the past.

37:05.360 --> 37:08.080
People make mistakes.

37:09.240 --> 37:11.240
I'm even everyone's psycho bitch.

37:11.680 --> 37:13.200
Just look at it as something funny.

37:15.600 --> 37:17.960
Doing this won't benefit you.

37:18.040 --> 37:19.640
Yeah. Stop it already.

37:20.160 --> 37:21.760
What do you want?

37:21.840 --> 37:24.360
Money? Or revenge?

37:25.320 --> 37:27.440
One person at a time.

37:27.520 --> 37:30.680
If you talk at the same time,
I won't be able to understand.

37:31.560 --> 37:33.000
But it's weird

37:33.080 --> 37:34.760
because when I was at school,

37:35.280 --> 37:37.840
not a single person wanted to talk to me.

37:38.320 --> 37:40.840
But right now,
you're all talking on top of each other.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.920
No one wants to talk
to you right now, either.

37:43.640 --> 37:45.440
Because you're a psycho bitch.

37:45.520 --> 37:47.560
Why don't you try talking
to the void again?

37:48.560 --> 37:50.280
You're not welcome here.

37:52.600 --> 37:53.760
Fong.

37:53.840 --> 37:56.240
Don't be mean to me.

37:57.360 --> 38:00.520
But that's okay. I get it.

38:01.360 --> 38:03.480
Fong has depression, right?

38:03.560 --> 38:05.480
You even have to take meds.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.960
Have you taken your meds today?

38:08.440 --> 38:09.480
Nanno, you bitch.

38:10.640 --> 38:14.760
An angel won't swear like that.

38:18.240 --> 38:20.480
By the way, Fong's outfit today

38:21.520 --> 38:23.560
is really as beautiful as an angel's.

38:24.200 --> 38:25.760
But it will be more beautiful

38:26.240 --> 38:27.760
if you take off your cardigan,

38:28.680 --> 38:31.320
showing off your pretty left arm.

38:40.840 --> 38:43.200
The prince must protect the angel.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.800
How romantic.

38:45.760 --> 38:46.880
Right, Tan?

38:59.920 --> 39:01.480
Why are you so quiet?

39:02.240 --> 39:04.240
Tan, don't you want to talk to me anymore?

39:10.560 --> 39:12.000
Sure, Tan.

39:13.920 --> 39:16.760
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

39:19.960 --> 39:21.200
It's so big.

39:21.280 --> 39:24.040
Tan must love Nanno very much.

39:25.000 --> 39:26.320
If he really loved me,

39:26.840 --> 39:28.360
he would have given them to me himself.

39:46.200 --> 39:48.200
Subtitle translation by Danaya Olarikded
